# ---- Session 41 (2026-10-01): third-party literature stays out of the repository for good ----
# Proposed by the read-only inventory in rh-program/results/purge-s41/ (PATHS-THIRD-PARTY.txt).
# APPEND THIS BLOCK AT THE VERY END of .gitignore. Git applies the LAST matching line, so the
# negations ("!") below must come after every ignore line, including the older ones above.
# Ignoring a path does not untrack it: files already tracked leave the index only through the
# purge itself (or "git rm --cached"). Block A is the proposal; blocks B and C are optional and
# only for the owner's decisions recorded in PATHS-OWNER-DECIDES.md.

# ================================ BLOCK A (proposed) ================================

# A1. Folders that only ever held third-party literature (anthropic/ is already ignored above).
/lamzouri/
/misc/
/rh-program/sources-extracted/
/rh-program/fetched*/

# A2. PDFs anywhere. The program's own builds stay trackable.
*.pdf
!/public/*.pdf
!/rh-program/results/arxiv/*/main.pdf
!/rh-program/results/c3-r/s14/alkl23-note.pdf
!/rh-program/results/c3-r/s14/alkl23-derivations.pdf

# A3. Page images. Every PNG ever committed under results/ was a scan, render or crop of a
# published page. A figure the program makes itself needs its own "!" line (or git add -f).
/rh-program/results/**/*.png
/rh-program/results/**/*.jpg
/rh-program/results/**/*.jpeg

# A4. Fetched text, markup and API dumps inside literature folders: sources*, *-sources, lit,
# pa, prior-art, fetched*, pages, img, api, zbmath, arxiv-queries. Logs and scripts (.log,
# .sh, .py) stay trackable; program notes kept in these folders use the names negated in A6.
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/*.txt
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/*.md
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/*.html
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/*.htm
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/*.json
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/*.tmp
/rh-program/results/**/sources*/**/jstor-*
/rh-program/results/**/*-sources/**
/rh-program/results/**/lit/**/*.txt
/rh-program/results/**/lit/**/*.md
/rh-program/results/**/lit/**/*.html
/rh-program/results/**/lit/**/*.json
/rh-program/results/**/pa/**
/rh-program/results/**/prior-art/**
/rh-program/results/**/fetched*/**
/rh-program/results/**/pages/**
/rh-program/results/**/img/**
/rh-program/results/**/api/**/*.json
/rh-program/results/**/api/**/*.md
/rh-program/results/**/api/**/*.html
/rh-program/results/**/zbmath/**
/rh-program/results/**/arxiv-queries/**/*.html

